{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064830/block/singleImage/3273155/df/01M7VG4326YW23WYGEQXA0EB66.jpg?updatedAt=1795145773\"/><figcaption>荔枝角嘉名工廠大廈火警冒濃煙，初步兩人不適。(Threads)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (20 日 ) 上午約 10 時半，警方接獲多人報案，指荔枝角青山道 688 至 690 號嘉名工廠大廈發生火警，其中一名報案人指自己身處起火單位內。 消防員接報派出搜救隊到場開喉撲救，約 15 分鐘後將火救熄。事件中約 60 人自行疏散，初步有兩人感到不適，其中一人戴上氧氣罩送往明愛醫院治理，初步調查相信是雜物起火肇禍。從網上影片可見，起火為露天有簷篷的位置，火光熊熊並冒出濃煙。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.267039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:36:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:12.841826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:17.737707+00:00","content_hash":"ff3c53c6a95715e885518fc95c7ebaf91af3f875a48be9bfd955d6cc94d7c2c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.267039+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}